  "description": "FTR.UI.WinForms is a modern UI component library for Windows Forms, supporting .NET Framework 4.7.2 and .NET 6+ for Windows.\n\nBuild professional desktop applications with customizable controls including RichTextBox, DataGridView, Buttons, Labels, Panels, Cards, Themes, and many other reusable WinForms components.\n\nThe library provides modern UI components, customizable themes, DPI-aware rendering, XML documentation, and an integrated licensing system for premium features.",
